  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "COMPLETELY REMODELED. DESIGNER QUALITY with OLD SEAGROVE BEACH CHARM. Details to make your trip enjoyable include Burt’s bees and Mrs Myers Products. Private spaces for everyone, yet many places to be together. Big home, Beautifully renovated home on quiet Seagrove Street with Private Pool. Pet Friendly. Invite your friends and family to enjoy group meals at the farm table over looking the pool, spacious open floor plan, fun media/bunk room for kids/teens. A quick under 5 minute walk to public beach access. This house has all the peace and tranquility you have come to expect from Seagrove, but away from the crowds! No worry about parking or traffic. Quick and easy trip to Publix or Seaside by avoiding 30A. Close to Everything. Middle of it all, without the crowds close by. <br>House has 4 Bedrooms and 4 Baths between the main house and separate apartment, with an additional bunkbed room/media room that sleeps four more people in the main home. Please Note ** the kitchen is on the second level of the house, with a farm table on the screened in second level porch^^ Watch over the pool, watch the colors of the sky change at sunset, while you dine and relax.<br>Rental includes: Main home + apartment attached to the main home, with it's own separate entrance. There is no shared entrance/doorway between the house and apartment (think carriage house, but attached to the back of the main home).<br><br>SPECIAL NOTE: Any spring break rental request will be fully vetted and limited to related family members. Chaperoned groups will not be allowed. Spring Break capacity will be limited to 10 people only. All names and ages must be included on request. Sorry for this extra step, but I care about the renters experience and I care about the house. <br><br>Maximum capacity: 12 total people. 10 in Main House (3 BR + Bunkroom) and 2 in apartment.<br><br><br><br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Great Location. Seaside/Old Seagrove, Private Pool, 3 Min Walk to Beach."
        }
      ],
